# ---- Model artefacts (large, environment-specific; regenerated at runtime) ----
# NOTE: saved_models/ is currently tracked. See docs/production-plan/02 & roadmap
# Phase 2 — these move to a model/metrics store. For Phase 0 we stop tracking
# NEW model artefacts; existing tracked ones can be removed in a dedicated commit.
flask-server/saved_models/*_lstm.pkl
flask-server/saved_models/*_scaler.pkl
flask-server/saved_models/_cached_metrics.json

